WEBVTT

NOTE Hollow Wake announcement trailer narration. Generated from trailer/project/js/timeline.js (the VO schedule) and the clip lengths.

1
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.710
The horn.

2
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:10.830
The tide.

3
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.090
The world going white...

4
00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:16.640
...then nothing at all.

5
00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:19.240
No road underfoot.

6
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.650
No breath left to catch.

7
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.100
Only a pale country of nothing...

8
00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:26.230
...and you.

9
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.530
A small light, adrift.

10
00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.830
Shapes stand in the stillness.

11
00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:35.521
Every one of them, a life you might yet wear back to the world.

12
00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:36.780
Drift to one.

13
00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.040
Take its hands.

14
00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:52.690
And when it falls...

15
00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.140
...wake again.

